      "title": {
        "en": "Gdzie to jest?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Meble* (furniture) is plural; one piece of furniture is *mebel*: *nowe meble*. A house may have *garaż* (a garage, *w garażu*) and *spiżarnia* (a pantry, *w spiżarni*). Go over where things are: *stoi*, *leży*, *wisi*; *w*, *na*, *przy*, *obok*; and what people think and talk about: *o synu*, *o sąsiedzie*, *o pracy*."
      }
    }
